  "vtables": [
    {
      "name": "ke_font_loader",
      "doc": "ABI-stable vtable for decoding font files (TTF/OTF/\u2026) on CPU. Async dispatch is the caller\u0027s concern (C# wraps with Task.Run on a worker); this contract stays minimal. Mirrors the ke_image_loader pattern \u2014 load returns raw bytes \u002B metadata, texture upload happens later via ke_render.",
